- An adversarial multi-agent review pass ran over the new modules; all confirmed findings are fixed in the last commit (outline separator index under search, mobile add path, inspector-follows-creation, live metadata in the canvas header, draft-accurate JSON export, answer_option-aware live sync, fieldset/toolbar interplay, module-boundary cleanup).

